        {
          "name": "pqscan:target",
          "value": "ML-DSA (FIPS 204); SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) where its size/speed trade-offs are acceptable"
        },
        {
          "name": "pqscan:rationale",
          "value": "Add ML-DSA (FIPS 204) verification so that migrated signers can be accepted. NIST IR 8547 defines 'legacy use' as processing already-protected data such as verifying an existing signature; whether Ed25519 verification of already-issued signatures keeps that status after 2035 is set by SP 800-131A (to be revised). Retain legacy verification only for already-issued signatures; do not accept new Ed25519 signatures after the transition."
        },
        {
          "name": "pqscan:policyVersion",
          "value": "1.1"
        },
